              <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
                <name>RegisterPaymentsByProxy</name>
                <id>120</id>
                <visible>true</visible>
                <enabled>true</enabled>
                <userVisible>
                  <common>true</common>
                </userVisible>
                <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
                  <segments>RegisterPaymentsByProxy</segments>
                </dataPath>
                <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>Use the &quot;Authorization letter for inventory receipt&quot; document to register receiving cash.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>برای ثبت دریافت وجه نقد از سند «وکالت‌نامه دریافت موجودی» استفاده کنید.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>Utilizzare il documento &quot;Procura per ricevere beni e materiali&quot; per dimostrare il fatto di ricevere fondi.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>Użyj dokumentu &quot;Pełnomocnictwo do odbioru wartości towarowo-materialnych&quot; do odzwierciedlenia faktu otrzymania środków pieniężnych.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>Использовать документ &quot;Доверенность на получение ТМЦ&quot; для отражения факта получения денежных средств.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>Nakit alımını yansıtmak için &quot;Stok alınması için yetki belgesi&quot; belgesini kullan.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTip>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>Sử dụng chứng từ &quot;Giấy ủy quyền để nhận hàng hóa&quot; để phản ánh thực tế về việc nhận tiền.</value>
                </toolTip>
                <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
                <handlers>
                  <event>OnChange</event>
                  <name>RegisterPaymentsByProxyOnChange</name>
                </handlers>
                <extendedTooltip>
                  <name>RegisterPaymentsByProxyExtendedTooltip</name>
                  <id>122</id>
                  <type>Label</type>
                  <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
                  <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
                  <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                    <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
                  </extInfo>
                </extendedTooltip>
                <contextMenu>
                  <name>RegisterPaymentsByProxyContextMenu</name>
                  <id>121</id>
                  <autoFill>true</autoFill>
                </contextMenu>
                <type>RadioButtonField</type>
                <editMode>Enter</editMode>
                <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
                <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
                <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
                <extInfo xsi:type="form:RadioButtonsFieldExtInfo">
                  <choiceList>
                    <presentation>
                      <key>en</key>
                      <value>Authorization letters</value>
                    </presentation>
                    <presentation>
                      <key>fa</key>
                      <value>وکالت‌نامه‌ها</value>
                    </presentation>
                    <presentation>
                      <key>it</key>
                      <value>Deleghe</value>
                    </presentation>
                    <presentation>
                      <key>pl</key>
                      <value>Uprawnienia</value>
                    </presentation>
                    <presentation>
                      <key>ru</key>
                      <value>Доверенности</value>
                    </presentation>
                    <presentation>
                      <key>tr</key>
                      <value>Yetki belgeleri</value>
                    </presentation>
                    <presentation>
                      <key>vi</key>
                      <value>Giấy ủy quyền</value>
                    </presentation>
